N5008 [class.copy.ctor]/14 + [temp.inst]/4: the comparator copy in libstdc++
_Rb_tree_key_compare(const _Key_compare&) odr-uses the implicitly-defined
copy constructor of std::less<int> only from a body finished in the LAST
elaboration stage (the half-converted-instance fixpoint); by then the
not-yet-used implicit members had already been cleared, so the copy
constructor was bodiless and the pair construction havocked.  Implicit
members used late are now elaborated; the clearing happens once at the end.
